  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/299045a58888d22ef71e832aac086cc997e6c731" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.671ex; width:2.355ex; height:2.176ex;" alt="{\displaystyle \scriptstyle {\sqrt {n}}}"/></span> because if <i id="mwKA">n</i> is <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Composite_number" title="Composite number" id="mwKQ">composite</a>, it must have at least one factor ≤ <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt21" id="mwKg" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"\\scriptstyle\\sqrt(n)"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle \scriptstyle {\sqrt {(}}n)}">
