  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/7ec4fa170b4f467956fe17e57a429010bf1d822c" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.671ex; width:3.909ex; height:2.676ex;" alt="{\displaystyle \scriptstyle {\sqrt {(}}n)}"/></span>, which would have been detected earlier; having all factors > <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt22" id="mwKw" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"\\scriptstyle\\sqrt(n)"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle \scriptstyle {\sqrt {(}}n)}">
